== tsp -h
usage: tsp [-h] [--universe UNIVERSE] [-q] {node,voice,jump,now} ...

TSP - That Space Program

positional arguments:
  {node,voice,jump,now}
    node                orbit maneuvers (committed when added)
    voice               the commentary voice (neural TTS)
    jump                jump Now forward (never back)
    now                 the universe clock

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --universe UNIVERSE   universe file (default universe/tsp.sqlite or
                        $TSP_UNIVERSE)
  -q, --quiet
rc=0
== tsp node --help
usage: tsp node [-h] [--at AT] [--prograde PROGRADE] [--radial RADIAL]
                [--alt ALT]
                {add,circularize,hohmann,list,rollback} [craft]

Maneuver nodes. Adding one flies the burn and commits it: the future is as
fixed as the past, until you roll it back.

positional arguments:
  {add,circularize,hohmann,list,rollback}
  craft                 craft name (default: newest in space)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --at AT               node time: apoapsis, periapsis, +30m, or UTC
  --prograde, --pro PROGRADE
                        m/s
  --radial, --rad RADIAL
                        m/s (outwards)
  --alt ALT             hohmann: target circular altitude, km
rc=0
